<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Fortis AG cut at Goldman.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Fortis AG cut at Goldman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fortis AG, the Belgian banking and insurance group, was cut to &quot;market underperformer&quot; from &quot;market performer&quot; at Goldman Sachs, the investment bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The Dutch arm of the group, Fortis Amev, was kept at a &quot;market performer&quot; rating.</p>
<p>Further detail was not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
